shape: sequence_diagram

gw: gateway prepareSchema
rq: index rqlite (leader)
other: another gateway

gw -> rq: WaitForLeader: SELECT 1 until it answers
gw -> rq: ensure schema_migrations and cluster_locks
gw -> rq: INSERT OR IGNORE lock row, then conditional UPDATE\nexpires_at 10 min
other -> rq: conditional UPDATE (loses: holder is set)
other -> other: poll every 2 s, up to 12 min
gw -> rq: SELECT version FROM schema_migrations (inside the lock)
gw -> rq: one transaction: statements + INSERT OR IGNORE tracker row
rq -> gw: committed or nothing applied
gw -> rq: release: UPDATE where holder is still me
other -> rq: acquires, re-reads applied set, finds nothing pending
gw -> rq: AssertSchema: MAX(version) >= required
